out.push(A('The rate with the stress on the denominator — _forty seconds a **call**_ — and then the annual size. ⚠ **Ask the room which it heard as the real figure**, and expect the annual one, **because it is the one that sounds like a decision.** Then the sentence the cycle ends on, which is Mr Darwish\'s and is the most useful thing in the unit: **I did not notice I was choosing.**'));
