out.push(A('The figure, then its premise, both flat and at the same speed. ⚠ **Listen for the voice dropping on the premise**, which turns it into an insinuation: **the room then hears an accusation about the writer instead of a question about the arithmetic**, and it is the commonest delivery fault in the unit. Then the sentence the cycle ends on, which is Mrs Khoury\'s and should stay on the board for 10.6: **the problems did not fall, the form fell on them, and our figure was perfectly accurate for two years.**'));
