out.push(A('The brother test, in the room if there is nobody outside it: **read the article to somebody and ask what they remember.** ⚠ **Two hundred words takes about seventy seconds and the asking takes four**, and **if they remember no figure the article has more than three.** Then the sentence the cycle ends on, which is Mr Attar\'s and is the one that matters for 10.7: **I reached for it about fifteen times in three meetings, and nobody asked me to.**'));
